  "description": "Day-in, day-out surf culture through the laidback simplicity of a cruiser emblematic of Del Sol's SoCal/Haro BMX herritage. From flip flops to checkered Vans to no shoes at all (no shoes = the preferred footwear of North County San Diego) the Cantina's your wingman (or wingwoman too!) for all things beach going, even if beach going isn't even on the menu. It's more of a mindset, and appreciation for the easygoing lifestyle that gave birth to Del Sol -- long live the simple, 1-speed steel cruiser -- here's to you, Cantina cruiser, may we all live like you.\nPedal-forward positioning creates foot-down ease at stops\nLow-slung frame design makes for easy mounting and dismounting\nAlloy wheels make for lightweight, rust-free durability\nCoaster brake makes for durable, simple stopping\nColor-matched chainguide prevents clothing or shoelaces getting munched by chain\nDel Sol elastomer-tuned Lounge Chair provides cush comfort for the long haul",
